# DIGITALIZEU — Complete Full-Stack Implementation Plan

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React (Vite) + Tailwind CSS v4 + Framer Motion
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express.js
- **Database**: MongoDB + Mongoose
- **Auth**: JWT (JSON Web Tokens)
- **File Upload**: Cloudinary
- **Notifications**: WhatsApp API redirect + Email (Nodemailer)

---

## Phase 1: Backend Foundation & Setup
> **Goal**: Express server, MongoDB connection, folder structure

### Tasks:
1. Create `server/` folder with Express app
2. Setup MongoDB connection with Mongoose
3. Setup environment variables (.env)
4. Setup CORS, body-parser, middleware
5. Create folder structure: `models/`, `routes/`, `controllers/`, `middleware/`, `utils/`

### Files to Create:
- `server/package.json`
- `server/index.js` (entry point)
- `server/config/db.js` (MongoDB connection)
- `server/.env`

---

## Phase 2: Authentication System
> **Goal**: Admin login/register with JWT

### Tasks:
1. Create Admin model (email, password, role)
2. Create auth routes (login, register, verify)
3. Create JWT middleware for protected routes
4. Hash passwords with bcrypt

### Files:
- `server/models/Admin.js`
- `server/routes/auth.js`
- `server/controllers/authController.js`
- `server/middleware/auth.js`

---

## Phase 3: Database Models (All Content)
> **Goal**: Create all MongoDB schemas

### Models to Create:
1. **Service** — title, subtitle, description, icon, gradient, features[], results, process[], isActive, order
2. **Package** — name, tagline, price, period, description, features[], popular, cta, badge, gradient, order
3. **Lead** — name, email, phone, selectedPackage, selectedService, message, budget, status, createdAt
4. **Contact** — name, email, subject, message, createdAt
5. **Blog** — title, excerpt, content, category, author, image, status, date
6. **Testimonial** — name, company, review, rating, image
7. **Founder** — name, role, expertise, bio, image, socials, achievements[], years
8. **SiteSetting** — siteName, contactEmail, phone, whatsappNumber, socialLinks, logo

---

## Phase 4: API Routes & Controllers (CRUD)
> **Goal**: Full CRUD APIs for all models

### Route Groups:
| Route | Methods | Description |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| `/api/auth` | POST login/register | Admin auth |
| `/api/services` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Services CRUD |
| `/api/packages` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Packages CRUD |
| `/api/leads` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Lead management |
| `/api/contacts` | GET, POST, DELETE | Contact form |
| `/api/blogs` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Blog management |
| `/api/testimonials` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Testimonials |
| `/api/founders` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Founders/team |
| `/api/settings` | GET, PUT | Site settings |
| `/api/upload` | POST | Cloudinary upload |

---

## Phase 5: Admin Panel — Connect to Backend
> **Goal**: Make admin panel fully functional with API calls

### Tasks:
1. Create API utility (axios instance with JWT headers)
2. Connect Services admin page → CRUD services from DB
3. Connect Packages admin page → CRUD packages
4. Connect Leads page → show all leads, update status
5. Connect Blogs, Testimonials, Founders, Settings pages
6. Add image upload via Cloudinary
7. Add real-time lead notification count

---

## Phase 6: Public Website — Dynamic Content
> **Goal**: Fetch all content from backend instead of hardcoded data

### Tasks:
1. Services section → fetch from `/api/services`
2. Packages section → fetch from `/api/packages`
3. Testimonials → fetch from `/api/testimonials`
4. Founders → fetch from `/api/founders`
5. Blog → fetch from `/api/blogs`
6. **Lead Capture Form** — when user clicks any package/service CTA:
   - Show modal form (name, email, phone, budget, message)
   - POST to `/api/leads`
   - Redirect to WhatsApp with pre-filled message
   - Send email notification to admin

---

## Phase 7: WhatsApp + Email Notifications
> **Goal**: Notify admin on every new lead

### Tasks:
1. WhatsApp redirect URL on form submit
2. Nodemailer email notification to admin
3. Lead status management (New → Contacted → Qualified → Closed)

---

## Phase 8: New Services — Video Editing & Brand Video
> **Goal**: Add new service categories

### New Services:
1. **Video Editing** — Professional video editing, color grading, motion graphics
2. **Brand Video Production** — Brand story videos, product demos, social media reels

These will be added via admin panel (dynamic, not hardcoded).

---

## Phase 9: Polish & Deployment
> **Goal**: Final testing, optimization, deployment

### Tasks:
1. Error handling & validation
2. Loading states & skeleton screens
3. Build optimization
4. Deploy backend to Render
5. Deploy frontend to Vercel
6. Configure environment variables in production

---

## Services List (Final)
### Keep:
- Meta Ads, Landing Pages, Funnel Building, Automation Systems, Lead Generation, Website Development

### Add New:
- Video Editing & Post-Production
- Brand Video Production

### Remove (via admin panel toggle):
- Analytics & Reporting (merge into dashboard)
- Brand Scaling (merge into other services)
